   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"6\">\n    <li>Here is a graph of the equation <span data-math=\"x+3y=6\">x+3y=6</span>.</li>\n  </ol>\n<img alt=\"A Cartesian coordinate system displays a straight line with a negative slope. The line intersects the y-axis at (0, 2) and the x-axis at (6, 0), extending through the first quadrant.\" class=\"img-fluid atto_image_button_text-bottom\" height=\"240\" src=\"exercises/media/2d8bf50affcf9b9e.png\" width=\"243\">\n  <p><strong>Select three</strong> coordinate pairs that represent a solution to the equation.</p>\n<ol type=\"a\">\n<li><span data-math=\"(0,2)\">(0,2)</span></li>\n<li><span data-math=\"(6,0)\">(6,0)</span></li>\n<li><span data-math=\"(2,6)\">(2,6)</span></li>\n<li><span data-math=\"(3,1)\">(3,1)</span></li>\n<li><span data-math=\"(8,−1)\">(8,−1)</span></li>\n<li><span data-math=\"(−1,2)\">(−1,2)</span></li>\n</ol>",
